		{
			dependencies: ["0AFCB00D0137832A"]
			description: [
				"This modpack has Tinker's Construct. Basically, instead of making \"stone\" or \"gold\" tools, you make tool &b&lheads, rods, &rand &l&bbindings.&r And these diffrent parts have quite a large effect on the tool itself. They effect &l&4minimg speed, &6mining level &r(i.e. can you mine iron ore? than that's &8stone&r mining level), and even &l&adurability.&rNow, this pack has &o&lGregtech&r, so Tinker's parts will also include materials from &l&oGregtech.&r Do you want a aluminium pickaxe? You can do that! Do you want a tungsten sword? You can do that! (although, I would not reccomend, seeing as tungsten is heavy)"
				""
				"And, the best part, you can make Gregtech tools with tinkers parts! No more are the days of making 300 files or 500 hammers, you need to make one, and just repair them with the kits! there &oare&r electric versions of the tools, but those take, y'know, electricity."
			]
			id: "1BDA3DA572EE5767"
			quest_enhance_disable_scroll_paging: false
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "Tool crafting of the future"
			tasks: [{
				id: "339459E2178910C0"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "Gregeric Tinkering"
			x: 1.0d
			y: 1.5d
		}
