		{
			dependencies: ["349082BB7A2ED6C3"]
			description: [
				"Tinker's construct has one of the best tool crafting systems in all of modded minecraft. You should have already played with this a little bit with the flint tools, but the melter unlocks so much more potential when it comes to making tools for all operations that tools fill. These tools are made by taking those patterns you made, making a tool part out of something cheap, and then you have two options:"
				""
				"1: Take some sand, craft it by itself, and you will get sand casts. Place these sand casts onto a casting table. You can then pour molten metal into the cast and you will get a metal tool part. HOWEVER, these sand casts are one time use, making them not very useful for casing lots of something."
				""
				"2: Your second option is to take the tool part and put it in the casting table by itself, and then pour molten gold on top of it. This will consume the tool part, but you will get a &lpermanent&r casting mold to use."
			]
			id: "7F28FE011A475D2A"
			quest_enhance_disable_scroll_paging: false
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "No, molten metal is not drinkable"
			tasks: [{
				id: "2D43C1396E9FC5AF"
				title: "Oh yah this is easy twin"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "Basics of Tinker's Metalworking"
			x: 2.5d
			y: -7.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: [
				"30CA407DEB90A998"
				"5AF5ABB5D65A3C3F"
			]
			dependency_requirement: "one_completed"
			description: ["[ \"There are two ways of making &6bronze&r, with one yielding more than the other. The first way is the dust method. This way is cheap and fast to do, although you only get three &6bronze&r ingots instead of the four ingots you would get from the other method. Speaking of the other method, the other method is the tinkers smeltery. If you want more information, read the \", { \"text\": \"Smeltery controller\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"5AF5ABB5D65A3C3F\" } }, \" quest.\" ]"]
			id: "04302C7369DF685E"
			quest_enhance_disable_scroll_paging: false
			shape: "gear"
			size: 2.0d
			subtitle: "First alloy :D"
			tasks: [{
				id: "3A411D0AE54EB7BD"
				item: "gtceu:bronze_ingot"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "&6Bronze&r Ingot&6"
