			x: 1.5d
			y: -7.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["349082BB7A2ED6C3"]
			description: ["This is the &lSmeltery Controller&r. Obtained by pouring 4 ingots worth of molten copper over a block of seared brick, it is basically a multiblock melter. And one of the best features this multi lets you use is &oAlloying&r. Alloying is when you have two molten metals in a smeltery and they touch. These metals then combine into a lovely little metal baby, otherwise known as an alloy. The main alloy you are going to make at the moment is &6bronze&r. &6Bronze&r being an alloy of three parts copper and one part tin, it is the main material in the &6Steam age&r, but that is explained more in the &6bronze&r quest and the &6Steam age&r quests."]
			id: "5AF5ABB5D65A3C3F"
			quest_enhance_disable_scroll_paging: false
			subtitle: "Big boy melter"
			tasks: [{
